b-1cab-4e80-b71f-21d71247bf6f" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"320"></sp=
an>
<p></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<h3 id=3D"TimeControl-AdditionalInformation:">Additional Information:</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><em>If no selection is made, then this panel will apply, in order, eithe=
r any global time zone selected in the Settings page or the platform defaul=
t Eastern time (UTC=E2=88=9205:00))</em></p></li>
<li>
<p><em>Times may be entered in either 12-hour or 24-hour format. 24-hour en=
tries will be converted to 12-hour.</em></p></li>
<li>
<p><em>Making a list or flowchart of the different time scenarios to addres=
s may be helpful in planning out what events to create.</em></p></li>
<li>
<p><em>Carefully consider the role that your default exit path should play =
in your Logic's flow. We highly recommend setting up an appropriate flow of=
 panels for your default path and testing it to your satisfaction. Any time=
 scenarios not addressed by your created events will go to the default exit=
 path instead, including scenarios that may be unexpected.</em></p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
    </div>
</body>
